  "raw_code": "(rule!\n ;; Headers as axes: cell (i,j) lights with the shared color when the i-th\n ;; LEFT header equals the j-th TOP header (headers dropped from the output).\n (let ((top (rest (first g)))\n       (left (map (lambda (r) (at g r 0)) (range 1 h))))\n   (for/list ((rowc (in-list left)))\n     (map (lambda (colc) (if (= rowc colc) rowc 0)) top))))",
